    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62422" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεοντο-φόνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lion-killing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῖκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.74
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ., ἡ</span>, <i>lionslayer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				BMus.Inscr.
				1061
			</span></i> (Cyrene, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεοντοφόνον, τό</span>, a Syrian insect <i>that poisons lions</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				845a28
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				4.18
			</span></i>.</div>
